{"id":"d5726b47e65d282e","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-pca.md","title":"部分组合代数","display":"df-pca — 部分组合代数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-pca","display":"df-pca — 部分组合代数","depends_on":["[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"Example 5.3.4, pp. 332–333 (PDF 352–353)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-pca"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-pca"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pca — 部分组合代数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Example 5.3.4, pp. 332–333 (PDF 352–353)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-pca</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是非空小集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot:A\\times A\\rightharpoonup A\">\\(\\cdot:A\\times A\\rightharpoonup A\\)</span> 为部分函数；应用左结合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ab\\coloneqq a\\cdot b\">\\(ab\\coloneqq a\\cdot b\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\downarrow\">\\(P\\downarrow\\)</span> 表示部分表达式有定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\simeq_KQ\">\\(P\\simeq_KQ\\)</span> 表示二者同时无定义或同时有定义且值相等。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PCA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PCA}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>、配对及投影的构造仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PCA}(A,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{PCA}(A,\\cdot)\\)</span> 成立的分支使用，并固定一个满足该定义的见证对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,S\">\\(K,S\\)</span>；这些记号相对于同一所选见证解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in A\">\\(a,b,c\\in A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in A\">\\(I\\in A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle-,-\\rangle_A:A^2\\to A\">\\(\\langle-,-\\rangle_A:A^2\\to A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_A\">\\(\\pi_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi&#39;_A:A\\rightharpoonup A\">\\(\\pi&#39;_A:A\\rightharpoonup A\\)</span> 的定义域分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{c\\in A\\mid cK\\downarrow\\}\">\\(\\{c\\in A\\mid cK\\downarrow\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{c\\in A\\mid c(KI)\\downarrow\\}\">\\(\\{c\\in A\\mid c(KI)\\downarrow\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pca}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PCA}(A,\\cdot)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists K,S\\in A)(\\forall x,y,z\\in A)\\bigl[{}&amp;K\\cdot x\\downarrow\\land S\\cdot x\\downarrow\\land (S\\cdot x)\\cdot y\\downarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\land (K\\cdot x)\\cdot y\\simeq_K x\\land ((S\\cdot x)\\cdot y)\\cdot z\\simeq_K(x\\cdot z)\\cdot(y\\cdot z)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pca}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PCA}(A,\\cdot)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists K,S\\in A)(\\forall x,y,z\\in A)\\bigl[{}&amp;K\\cdot x\\downarrow\\land S\\cdot x\\downarrow\\land (S\\cdot x)\\cdot y\\downarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\land (K\\cdot x)\\cdot y\\simeq_K x\\land ((S\\cdot x)\\cdot y)\\cdot z\\simeq_K(x\\cdot z)\\cdot(y\\cdot z)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI&amp;\\coloneqq SKK,\\\\\n\\langle a,b\\rangle_A&amp;\\coloneqq S(SI(Ka))(Kb),\\\\\n\\pi_A(c)&amp;\\coloneqq cK,\\qquad\\pi&#39;_A(c)\\coloneqq c(KI).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI&amp;\\coloneqq SKK,\\\\\n\\langle a,b\\rangle_A&amp;\\coloneqq S(SI(Ka))(Kb),\\\\\n\\pi_A(c)&amp;\\coloneqq cK,\\qquad\\pi&#39;_A(c)\\coloneqq c(KI).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=SKK\">\\(I=SKK\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ia=a\">\\(Ia=a\\)</span>。组合完备性允许写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda x.M\">\\(\\lambda x.M\\)</span> 作为由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,K\">\\(S,K\\)</span> 消去变量后得到的代数元素。</li>\n<li>配对可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\lambda z.zab\">\\(\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\lambda z.zab\\)</span>，投影取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi c=cK\">\\(\\pi c=cK\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi&#39;c=c(KI)\">\\(\\pi&#39;c=c(KI)\\)</span>。这里的等式是部分应用等式。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Example 5.3.4, pp. 332–333 (PDF 352–353)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot:A\\times A\\rightharpoonup A","display":false},{"tex":"ab\\coloneqq a\\cdot b","display":false},{"tex":"P\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"P\\simeq_KQ","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PCA}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PCA}(A,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"K,S","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle-,-\\rangle_A:A^2\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi'_A:A\\rightharpoonup A","display":false},{"tex":"\\{c\\in A\\mid cK\\downarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{c\\in A\\mid c(KI)\\downarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pca}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PCA}(A,\\cdot)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists K,S\\in A)(\\forall x,y,z\\in A)\\bigl[{}&K\\cdot x\\downarrow\\land S\\cdot x\\downarrow\\land (S\\cdot x)\\cdot y\\downarrow\\\\\n&\\land (K\\cdot x)\\cdot y\\simeq_K x\\land ((S\\cdot x)\\cdot y)\\cdot z\\simeq_K(x\\cdot z)\\cdot(y\\cdot z)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nI&\\coloneqq SKK,\\\\\n\\langle a,b\\rangle_A&\\coloneqq S(SI(Ka))(Kb),\\\\\n\\pi_A(c)&\\coloneqq cK,\\qquad\\pi'_A(c)\\coloneqq c(KI).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I=SKK","display":false},{"tex":"Ia=a","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda x.M","display":false},{"tex":"S,K","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\lambda z.zab","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi c=cK","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi'c=c(KI)","display":false}],"bytes":1983,"backlinks":[{"id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"使用含有 $\\mathbb N$ 的 Grothendieck 宇宙及 [[16-df-set]] 的集合记号。$k,m,n,a,b,e\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathbb N^0=\\{()\\}$；$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$，$(\\vec x,n)$ 表示在有限元组末尾添加一个分量，坐标从 $0$ 开始。一元图通过 $n\\mapsto(n)$ 与 $\\mathbb N$ 上的偏函数识别。偏函数用其单值关系图编码；$f(\\vec x)\\downarrow$、$\\simeq_K$ 采用 [[16-df-pca]] 的有定义性与 Kleene 相等约定。"},{"id":"f36bc28426b1a7dc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$r_A$ 及其同一个 PCA $(A,\\cdot)$、宇宙 $\\mathcal U$ 采用 [[16-df-realizability-fibration]]。固定 [[16-df-pca]] 构造分支的同一见证 $K,S$、由其定义的 $I$、配对和投影；$U,V\\subseteq A$。"},{"id":"2e315868bd6a1509","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$；$A\\in\\mathcal U$，$(A,\\cdot)$ 为 [[16-df-pca]] 的 PCA，$\\Omega=\\mathcal P(A)$。$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-set]] 的带标签箭头；$\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}$ 采用 [[16-df-split-generic]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"}],"outgoing":["09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}